# Parameter fragment for gemma4:31b (frontier tier: forensic upgrade on >= 24 GB VRAM).
# pull-models.sh prepends `FROM <verified GGUF>` when registering the model in the air-gap profile;
# the chat TEMPLATE is taken from the chat template embedded in the GGUF.
